<title>BELARUS: Belarus rouble slipped down to 15,500 per dlr in Minsk.</title>
<headline>Belarus rouble slipped down to 15,500 per dlr in Minsk.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belarussian rouble edged down to 15,900 per dollar on the Minsk Interbank Currency Exchange from 15,500 at the previous session.</p>
<p>				    January 3	   December 26</p>
<p> Rate to dollar		    15,900		15,500</p>
<p> Volume traded		  $2.021 million	  $5.327 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
</text>
